      {
        "path": "patches/explicit-equipment-category-trigger-aliases.patch",
        "reason": "Rust CLI2.3.0 treats enum-based trigger keys as an unrestricted fallback; even always=perhaps passed. Expand equipment_category into the exact38 aliases from supplied vanilla script_enum_equipment_category, preserving unit_leader/combat scope constraints. Unknown triggers and wrong booleans then fail correctly.",
